-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
org.json
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The bridge envelope is parsed with org.json, which on a release build is the
implementation supplied by the Android framework rather than a bundled artifact
(it does not appear in the APK or in mapping.txt). The org.json:json Maven
artifact appears in this build as a testImplementation dependency only, so that
the JVM unit tests exercise a real implementation instead of the stub android.jar
throws; it is not distributed.
